{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"edits\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他高兴得有点收不住，想到两个人也许能互相依靠，心里忽然一紧，却还想这样待着。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"note\": \"只带回S07想到互相依靠时忽然心里一紧、却仍想继续待在一起的瞬间。这是幸福内部突然出现的不安，与单纯舍不得离开欢喜不同，也能接住S06对方是否也舍不得的猜想，同时为S07-3继续盼望陪伴留出空间。保留当前稿的高兴开头和日常口气，去掉略显书面的从欢喜里抽身。没有带回S09的还是没底：S09-1已经具体写出害怕失去，S09-2写出因此不敢继续往下想，S10-1又明确写出他选择暂时不猜未来，心事并未解决。再加一句仍然没底会重复已有心理动作。S11和S13的关系推进、时间无法留住幸福的认识，以及S14最终不再隐藏喜欢的选择，全部保留。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "18d537c8-fce1-4b57-a483-e009850ea2dd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T203617477054Z", "elapsed_seconds": 31.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T20:36:48.913051+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "31e51231c89a407fdb6611c7c74f4fe1c287efaa935fb7ea70769a08005e8404", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_